  <item>
    <title>Vol.04「过去，现在，与未来。」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67178238db2cf827571c5163</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67178238db2cf827571c5163</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Oct 2024 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>致伟大的冒险家：</span></strong></p><p><span>早上中午晚上好。欢迎跨越时空来到今日的果壳宇宙。</span></p><p><span>今天，我们一起来到</span><strong><span>「成长」</span></strong><span>的星球。</span></p><p><span>本期的主题是：</span><strong><em><span>过去，现在，与未来。</span></em></strong></p><p><span>也许我会在长大后的某一个路口等着小时候的自己吧（握拳</span></p><p><span>有些人想要通往梦寐以求的</span><strong><span>未来</span></strong><span>，有些人想要回到日思夜想的</span><strong><span>童年</span></strong><span>。在时间这样一条长线中，我们总是显得</span><strong><span>有些手足无措</span></strong><span>。今天，我们邀请到了我们的好友——实习生</span><em><s><span>（她自己讲的）</span></s></em><span>小竺。在本期节目中，小竺、心心与小鼠将和大家一起来聊一聊我们所</span><strong><span>怀念、期待与迷惘的那些“成长”</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>如今的我们正处于人生最迷茫的时期——已经告别了童年，却仍未等来真正的“成人”。纵使无法看清眼前的道路，又隐约能见得未来在向我招手。</span><em><span>而我呆愣在原地，踌躇不前。</span></em></p><p><span>生活的每一秒经历都在一点点造就为一个</span><strong><span>“成熟”</span></strong><span>的我。我们无时无刻不在成长，也不知是从何时开始，或许“想要长大”变成了“不想长大”。</span></p><p><strong><em><span>所以，有谁知道，未来会怎样呢？</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>今日话题纵览：</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 开头</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 我已经长大的“长大”</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> 曾经梦寐以求的长大</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2188">36:28</a> 和我一起长大的____</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3241">54:01</a> 成长的收获与代价</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3634">01:00:34</a> 什么影响了我的成长？</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4591">01:16:31</a> “成人”与“成年人”</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5442">01:30:42</a> 幼稚是可以贯穿一生的词</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5781">01:36:21</a> 属于我的未来——</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6078">01:41:18</a> 结尾</span></p></li></ul><p><span>BGM：Billie Eilish --Getting Older</span></p><p><span>以及，</span></p><p><span>以下是陪伴我们长大的玩偶大赏！_：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtX70QdBtfveOxcia7ctPxQtR7yL.jpg"></figure><p></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhtS2rWlsjNDAwsHG84uF4PmIhzG.jpg"></figure><p><span></span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lufyC9z5OQZqle_hekIA2A-CEaEu.jpg"></figure><p><em><span>桦里书&amp;马心心&amp;小竺</span></em><span> </span><strong><span>敬上</span></strong></p><p><span>2024.10.25</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhlvyATmiu8n21UtU7vMtIltomV-.m4a" length="102381002" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:45:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjmxPF0n3djtFVetZwI0N8T_kGp.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.03「拜托，这可是钱啊！」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f3a77d2adfe48b834c9cfd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f3a77d2adfe48b834c9cfd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>致伟大的冒险家：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>早上中午晚上好。欢迎跨越时空来到今日的果壳宇宙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我们一起来到</span><strong><span>「金钱」</span></strong><span>的星球。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的主题是：</span><em><strong><span>拜托，这可是钱啊！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>钱什么的，最是美丽了。（点头</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由？理想？爱情？追求？</span></p><span></span><p><span>不好意思。本期节目中，桦里书和心心将跟大家来聊掉</span><del><span>“庸俗”</span></del><em><span>（不是）</span></em><strong><span>“现实”</span></strong><span>的：</span><strong><span>钱。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>钱，当代具备自主意识的人类</span><strong><span>出奇</span></strong><em><span>（？）</span></em><strong><span>一致</span></strong><span>的追求。从萌生了独立意识到小朋友们，到已然深谙社会现实的各位成年人。谁不喜欢钱啊？！</span><em><span>（直击灵魂）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>不同年纪的我们，不同阅历的我们。我们从哪里得到，又选择怎样支配。钱是物质生活的基础，某种意义上，也是生活的缩略写照。金钱，看起来是一个这样</span><strong><span>具像而可控</span></strong><span>的存在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于钱的追求，也似乎是</span><strong><span>对于某种需求的映射</span></strong><span>。中国现代社会有太多我们无法具体阐释的社会学、经济学现象。我们需要得到满足，而物质又总是满足感最切实也最直接的体现。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>我们总是无法看清风暴的形状，却从未逃离风雨。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>今日话题纵览：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开头</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 你问我对钱的见解啊</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">07:53</a> 钱？到底为什么爱钱</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 无稳定收入，但输出</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2725">45:25</a> 赚钱&amp;花钱的关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3218">53:38</a> 关于钱和道德</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3614">1:00:14</a> 物质真的是前提吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4058">1:07:38</a> 生活啊，本来就是做交易</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4225">1:10:25</a> 结尾</span><em><span>（恭喜发财！</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM：Ariana Grande-7 rings</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>桦里书&amp;马心心</span></em><span> </span><strong><span>敬上</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2024.9.26</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqcKcR6Ji5MQiC5OY467qORzDt0k.m4a" length="71551409" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjmxPF0n3djtFVetZwI0N8T_kGp.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.02「妈妈，生活它要吃掉我。」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ca286a7ae3d6d8d2dfe8b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ca286a7ae3d6d8d2dfe8b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Aug 2024 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>致伟大的冒险家：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>早上中午晚上好。欢迎跨越时空来到今日的果壳宇宙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我们一起到达</span><strong><span>“生活”</span></strong><span>的星球。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的主题是：</span><em><strong><span>妈妈，生活它要吃掉我。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>生活，你好可怕。（</span><em><span>不是</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>我们每个人都被生活的洪流包围着。在本期节目中，小鼠与心心将共同谈论生活中那些令我们</span><strong><span>情绪波动</span></strong><span>的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道何时开始，年龄增加的同时也带来了我们身上的负担。亦或是感知烦恼和情绪的能力。生活不再是单纯而美好，它使我们内耗，使我们焦虑，使我们迷茫，使我们几度陷入对自己的怀疑...</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们被身边的人事物压得喘不过气时，该如何</span><em><span>“</span></em><em><strong><span>自救</span></strong></em><em><span>”</span></em><span>？身陷“夹缝”中的我们应该如何</span><em><span>“</span></em><em><strong><span>生存</span></strong></em><em><span>”</span></em><span>？面对着起起伏伏的生活，去选择</span><strong><span>接受</span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span>改变</span></strong><span>，还是是</span><strong><span>甩开</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“生活”二字涵盖了太多。生活是过去、当下，还有未来</span><strong><span>。</span></strong><span>生活是</span><strong><span>所思所想所知所感的一切</span></strong><span>。也因而，不论如何，生活都会继续。我们都要书写下一个故事的篇章。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都是生活的冒险家。我们也都是生活着的梦想家。所以，</span><em><strong><span>请勇敢地追寻我们的美好</span></strong></em><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日话题纵览：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span><em><span>（开头）</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 生活是一个巨大的_____</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 最近的生活状态&amp;精神状态</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 关于那些负面情绪们</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> 为什么有人惨得苍白有人惨得诗意</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> 最近的情绪波动是为何</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3657">60:57</a> “情绪易感期”&amp; 人类是有极限的啊喂</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4232">70:32</a> 我们如何改变or接受or扔掉！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4538">75:38</a> </span><em><span>（结尾）</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM：Laufey-Falling Behind</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>桦里书&amp;马心心</span></em><span> </span><strong><span>敬上</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2024.8.25</span></p>]]></description>
