    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Aug 2024 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>致伟大的</span><strong><span>冒险家</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>早上中午晚上好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到</span><strong><span>不定期开张的宇宙餐厅</span></strong><span>享用今日的精神食粮。</span></p><span></span><p><span>宇宙餐厅今天的主厨是</span><em><span>心心</span></em><span>。主菜是一篇写在梦前的</span><strong><span>随笔</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是某个晚上睡不着觉时零零碎碎的思绪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，冒险家。请坐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>闭上眼睛，和我一起做一会儿</span><strong><span>白日梦</span></strong><span>吧。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今日食谱</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>前菜</span></strong></em><span>（</span><em><span>BGM</span></em><span>）：Old Money-Lana Del Rey</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>主食</span></strong></em><span>：心心de深夜随笔</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>马心心</span></em><span> </span><strong><span>敬上</span></strong></p>]]></description>
