  <item>
    <title>Vol.01「也许我们不懂爱。」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a7569233ddcbb53cd941f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a7569233ddcbb53cd941f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jul 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>致伟大的冒险家：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>早上中午晚上好。欢迎跨越时空来到今日的果壳宇宙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我们一起到达</span><strong><span>“谈爱”</span></strong><span>的星球。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的主题是：</span><em><strong><span>也许我们不懂爱</span></strong></em><em><span>。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中，常驻主播桦里书和心心将与大家讨论一些关于</span><strong><span>爱</span></strong><span>的话题——一些关于</span><strong><span>十几岁的年纪会比较敏感的爱</span></strong><span>。并且有</span><em><span>特邀嘉宾</span></em><span>：我们的好朋友@液体易碎老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在现代社会，“爱”是一个沉落在人海里的概念。确定本期主题的时候我们就在思考，要如何谈爱而不“落俗”。可是转念一想，爱又如何定义落俗呢。</span><strong><span>爱就是爱。</span></strong><span>爱就是热忱而清醒，迷醉又挣扎。我们都不懂爱，年轻的我们，年长的他们。我们都在学爱，也在被爱。在任何时间线的任意一点上，我们都是爱的初学者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱就是，在无限长远的空间和时间里，我们无限次地迷路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日话题纵览：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> （</span><em><span>开头</span></em><span>）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 爱对于你而言是什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1286">21:26</a> 聊聊我们关于“爱”的经历&amp;感想</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a>“爱”与“被爱”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2956">49:16</a> “长大”和“爱”的关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3779">01:02:59</a> 从理想出发看爱（理想型/理想亲密关系）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4558">01:15:58</a> 爱的勇士和胆小鬼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4947">01:22:27</a>（</span><em><span>结尾</span></em><span>）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM：Billie Eilish-i love you</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>桦里书&amp;马心心&amp;液体易碎</span></em><span> </span><strong><span>敬上&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2024.7.29</span></p>]]></description>
